        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "text": "This property location is spectacular with beautiful beach views and access. For our party of 12 we had plenty of room. Negatives were that virtually nothing is provided. No beach chairs, empty propane tank, no condiments, worn mattresses, etc. For the price paid, I would expect a little more to be included. This is also a “duplex” which wasn’t clear, so we had neighbors. That said, we had a great time and really enjoyed the location. I would return to this area again for sure.",
